  english: "Surrounded by dazzling rings is Saturn.\nIt has a radius of 58,232 kilometers,
    a mass of 5.68 \xD7 10^26 kilograms, and orbits 1.43 billion kilometers from
    the Sun. Saturn\u2019s beauty hides violent winds and crushing pressure beneath
    its clouds."
